21:["$","p","Use this page as a map for common engineering jobs: validate structured data, compare text, decode tokens, generate identifiers, transform encodings, inspect colors, calculate permissions, and prepare clean payloads before they move into production systems.",{"className":"border-l-2 border-blue-200 pl-4 leading-7 text-slate-700 dark:border-blue-900 dark:text-slate-300","children":"Use this page as a map for common engineering jobs: validate structured data, compare text, decode tokens, generate identifiers, transform encodings, inspect colors, calculate permissions, and prepare clean payloads before they move into production systems."}]
22:["$","p","Every tool linked from this hub runs directly in the browser. No installs, no CLI setup, no API keys. That makes it practical for quick checks during code review, incident response, pair programming, technical interviews, and any situation where opening a full IDE or terminal would break momentum.",{"className":"border-l-2 border-blue-200 pl-4 leading-7 text-slate-700 dark:border-blue-900 dark:text-slate-300","children":"Every tool linked from this hub runs directly in the browser. No installs, no CLI setup, no API keys. That makes it practical for quick checks during code review, incident response, pair programming, technical interviews, and any situation where opening a full IDE or terminal would break momentum."}]
